initialisers.bas:10:25: error: a name given a value needs its own type: write 'Dim b As <type> = value' (other names in the Dim take theirs)
initialisers.bas:11:9: error: 'c' needs a type, such as 'As Integer' or 'As String' (a value does not give it one)
