initialisers.bas:14:25: error: 'f' has a fixed size; only a dynamic array, 'Dim f() As ...', takes a list
initialisers.bas:15:24: error: a list in braces gives an array its values, but 'n' is not an array
initialisers.bas:16:26: error: 'g' has 1 dimension but the list has 2 (one level of braces each)
initialisers.bas:17:36: error: this list has 1 item but the one before it has 2 (an array's rows are all the same length)
